The sibling of the dry-then-wet case, isolating the negative half: after a lone `--dry-run` the
artifact still carries no `metrics_*` key, even though stdout reports a full set of numbers for it.

Arithmetic, s-hotel: one turn, 07:00:00 → 07:02:00 = 120s = 2 minutes; tokens input 5, output 1, no
cache fields = 0; model claude-fx-haiku.

